  "description": "Recognize and synthesize speech in Windows applications using Acapela, Cepstral, CereProc CereVoice, Microsoft SAPI-compliant, Microsoft Speech Platform, Microsoft WindowsMedia, and Nuance Dragon NaturallySpeaking speech recognizers and synthesizers.\n\nChant Talk&Listen enables applications to synthesize and recognize speech.\n\nSometimes applications need a simple way to synthesize and recognize. Chant Talk&Listen application enables applications to synthesize and recognize speech without having to worry about events, properties, and callback handlers.\n\nDocumentation is available at https://www.chant.net/support/documentation/helpers.\n\nSamples are available at https://www.chant.net/support/downloads.\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires a purchased license for use. Evaluation credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/support/downloads. Purchased licensed credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/store. See https://www.chant.net/products/helpers for more information about evaluating and purchasing licenses.",
